{{ENExclusive}}
'''Shakurel Face''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Shakurel Planet Collaboration Event]] and the [[Catclaw Dojo]]. It was added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]].

