==Enemy==
Shakurel Face is a variant of [[The Face]] that has a large chin. Minimal design features have been changed other than the chin. It also has four times higher attack and health than [[The Face]].

==Strategy==
Treat this enemy as you would to The Face, any [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating Cats]] can help defeat this enemy.

